  <!-- Case Study Spotlights (3) -->
  <section class="py-5 bg-white" id="case-studies">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="text-center mb-5">
        <h2 class="heading-border heading-center mb-3 pb-3 d-inline-block">Case Study Spotlights</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="row g-4">
        <div class="col-12 col-lg-4">
          <div class="workflow-card p-4 p-lg-5 h-100">
            <h4 class="h5 mb-3">Healthcare AI Platform, Voice, Scribe &amp; EHR</h4>
            <p class="small text-muted mb-2">Multi-location clinics / HIPAA + athenahealth</p>
            <h5 class="h6 mt-3 mb-1">Challenge</h5>
            <p class="small mb-2">High no-show rates, after-hours call backlog, and disconnected scheduling/doc workflows created operational bottlenecks and provider burnout.</p>
            <h5 class="h6 mb-1">Solution</h5>
            <p class="small mb-2">Built one platform for web + voice booking, real-time athenahealth sync, audit-logged status updates, and an AI medical scribe with strict hallucination prevention.</p>
            <h5 class="h6 mb-1">Results</h5>
            <ul class="small mb-0 ps-3" style="line-height: 1.6;">
              <li>Reduces no-shows through AI scheduling, reminders, and waitlist automation</li>
              <li>Improves revenue capture via fewer missed appointments and cleaner booking/billing workflows</li>
              <li>Cuts clinician documentation time via an ambient AI scribe with provider-in-the-loop review</li>
            </ul>
            <%= link_to "Read full case study →", case_study_path('medical-voice-ai'), class: "d-inline-block mt-3 fw-semibold small ajax" %>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-12 col-lg-4">
          <div class="workflow-card p-4 p-lg-5 h-100">
            <h4 class="h5 mb-3">Voice Booking Agent (Low Latency)</h4>
            <p class="small text-muted mb-2">After-hours booking + warm transfers</p>
            <h5 class="h6 mt-3 mb-1">Challenge</h5>
            <p class="small mb-2">After-hours calls hit voicemail, reschedules are slow, and staff can’t respond while a motivated patient is on the phone.</p>
            <h5 class="h6 mb-1">Solution</h5>
            <p class="small mb-2">Twilio streams audio to Deepgram Nova-2 for real-time transcription; intent runs through a PHI de-identification pipeline before Claude; responses are spoken via ElevenLabs TTS. The agent handles booking, rescheduling, cancellations, and general inquiries, with warm transfer on request and after-hours calls routed to a callback queue.</p>
            <h5 class="h6 mb-1">Results</h5>
            <ul class="small mb-0 ps-3" style="line-height: 1.6;">
              <li>Fast, natural voice interactions with real-time transcription and low-latency responses</li>
              <li>Fewer abandoned calls via immediate voice rescheduling</li>
              <li>Staff gets context-rich warm transfers when needed</li>
            </ul>
            <%= link_to "Read full case study →", case_study_path('medical-voice-ai'), class: "d-inline-block mt-3 fw-semibold small ajax" %>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-12 col-lg-4">
          <div class="workflow-card p-4 p-lg-5 h-100">
            <h4 class="h5 mb-3">AI Medical Scribe (Faster SOAP Notes)</h4>
            <p class="small text-muted mb-2">No-audio-storage + no-fabrication guardrails</p>
            <h5 class="h6 mt-3 mb-1">Challenge</h5>
            <p class="small mb-2">Providers lose significant time to after-visit SOAP notes (“pajama time”). Any fabricated detail is a clinical safety risk.</p>
            <h5 class="h6 mb-1">Solution</h5>
            <p class="small mb-2">Deepgram diarization separates provider vs patient speech. Claude generates a SOAP note with strict rules: never fabricate findings, mark gaps as [Not discussed], mark uncertain items as [VERIFY], and suggest ICD-10 codes validated against CMS before display. Providers approve before pushing to athenahealth via FHIR. Audio is never stored—only encrypted transcript persists.</p>
            <h5 class="h6 mb-1">Results</h5>
            <ul class="small mb-0 ps-3" style="line-height: 1.6;">
              <li>Cuts SOAP documentation time with provider-in-the-loop review before EHR write-back</li>
              <li>Provider-in-the-loop approval before EHR write-back</li>
              <li>Encrypted transcript persistence with full audit logging</li>
            </ul>
            <%= link_to "Read full case study →", case_study_path('medical-voice-ai'), class: "d-inline-block mt-3 fw-semibold small ajax" %>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


